  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "42-CrMo steel components are currently used in hot-dip aluminum-plating equipment.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "42-CrMo steel equipment components degrade rapidly when directly exposed to molten aluminum.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "WVTaTiCr refractory high-entropy-alloy coatings can be deposited on 42-CrMo steel using laser cladding.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::000::abstract::d0fb87d7d2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The WVTaTiCr coating composition can be tailored by modifying its chromium content.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::000::abstract::d0fb87d7d2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The laser-cladded WVTaTiCr coating will be dense and adherent.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will form a stable, protective oxide scale at its interface with molten aluminum.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::000::abstract::d0fb87d7d2",
        "PMC10142552::chunk::001::introduction::6f0510eec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protective scale may comprise stable tungsten, vanadium, tantalum, titanium, and chromium oxides.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increasing chromium content in WVTaTiCr coatings improves their high-temperature oxidation resistance.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::000::abstract::d0fb87d7d2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Suitable additions of chromium to refractory high-entropy alloys can promote formation of a dense surface oxidation film at high temperature.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::001::introduction::6f0510eec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The tailored WVTaTiCr composition will promote in-situ formation of a stable oxide layer during operation in molten aluminum.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::000::abstract::d0fb87d7d2",
        "PMC10142552::chunk::001::introduction::6f0510eec9"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide layer will act as a barrier that reduces chemical reactions with molten aluminum.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The oxide layer will reduce physical erosion caused by molten aluminum.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Laser-cladded WVTaTiCr parts will have significantly better molten-aluminum corrosion resistance than uncoated 42-CrMo steel.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10142552::chunk::000::abstract::d0fb87d7d2"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will reduce material loss and prevent direct attack by molten aluminum.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The coating will extend the service life of hot-dip aluminum-plating equipment components.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The protective effect is expected under the operating conditions of hot-dip aluminum plating.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Performance in other molten-metal systems or under extreme thermal cycling is uncertain.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The long-term behavior and quantitative reduction in corrosion rate during direct molten-aluminum exposure remain uncertain.",
      "field": "uncertainty",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
